2026-07-27T08:14:40.5799283Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5875450Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5876047Z i /tmp/RtmpJ7UMh0/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5876447Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5876896Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5877549Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5878180Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5879180Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:14:40.5879840Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:14:40.6126808Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.6236456Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.6687110Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:14:40.6863342Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
